      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-05-17T05:34:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "S5 no, but S3/S0ix, yes.\n\nCutting power and setting state vs. applying power and determining state seem like two sides of the same coin to me. Just curious, why do you prefer cutting power?",
      "parentUuid": "fdaf03f9_373a62d7",
      "revId": "344ec3d70961b2fa5ce3ff09a799581070fe9208",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
